======================================================================
TensorComp tc.ld ISA Tests (C version)
======================================================================

Instruction Encoding:
  - Opcode: 0x5B (CUSTOM-2)
  - funct7: 0000100 (0x04)
  - funct3: 000
  - Format: tc.ld tds, imm(rs)
    where: tds = target TC reg [0-31], imm = 5-bit signed offset [-16,+15], rs = base addr register

Configuration:
  - tmask_ld: Load mask (32-bit, each bit controls a split load)
  - tstride_ld[0:31]: Stride registers for address calculation

CSR Address Mapping:
  - tmask_ld:      0x800
  - tstride_ld:    0x820-0x83F


